nmp.onnx is the unmodified ONNX export of Basic Pitch's pretrained model
(basic_pitch/saved_models/icassp_2022/nmp.onnx).

What showtime changed: nothing in the model. showtime runs it with onnxruntime (no TensorFlow) and ported two
parts of the Python package to numpy/scipy in lib/st/xray_music.py: the windowing of the audio
(basic_pitch.inference.run_inference) and the conversion of the model output to note events
(basic_pitch.note_creation: output_to_notes_polyphonic and model_frames_to_time, with the package's defaults).
Pitch bends are not ported. The note events feed showtime's own tempo, key, chord, MIDI and MusicXML code.

